flowchart TD
  Request[POST audit request] --> RequestID[Create request ID]
  RequestID --> Logging[Structured request logging]
  Logging --> RateLimit[Rate limit decision]
  RateLimit -->|Exceeded| RateReject[429 rate limit response]
  RateLimit -->|Unavailable| LimiterUnavailable[503 limiter unavailable]
  RateLimit -->|Allowed| JsonParser[Route JSON parser]
  JsonParser --> ContentPolicy[Content type and body policy]
  ContentPolicy --> Validation[Validate request body]
  Validation --> Normalize[Normalize URL]
  Normalize --> CacheOne[First cache lookup]
  CacheOne -->|Hit| HitResponse[Return cached response]
  CacheOne -->|Miss| Semaphore[Acquire semaphore]
  Semaphore -->|Capacity exceeded| CapacityError[503 capacity response]
  Semaphore --> CacheTwo[Second cache lookup]
  CacheTwo -->|Hit| ReleaseHit[Release permit and return cached response]
  CacheTwo -->|Miss| Safety[Destination safety and DNS]
  Safety --> Transport[Safe transport and redirects]
  Transport --> Analysis[HTML analysis]
  Analysis --> Scoring[Scoring]
  Scoring --> CacheSet[Safe cache storage]
  CacheSet --> Release[Release permit]
  Release --> Response[Controller response]
  JsonParser -->|Invalid JSON| Error[Central error response]
  ContentPolicy -->|Unsupported media| Error
  Validation -->|Invalid body| Error
  Safety -->|Blocked or DNS failure| Error
  Transport -->|Transport error| Error
  Analysis -->|Analysis error| Error
  Scoring -->|Scoring error| Error
